# carmodels .gitignore — decided by Jev battery tools/battery_gitignore.py
# (receipts: research/evidence/vehicle-completeness/jev-gitignore/).
# Split: lean 0.85. Keep tools, receipts, reference corpus, viewer GLBs,
# AppImage, screenshots. Ignore vendor blobs, savestates/dumps, working
# sets, bytecode. Fresh-clone note: savestates/dumps are re-captured live
# via PINE in the container; GLB builds need Blender (re-download);
# validation receipts keep sha256 pins of the excluded files.
#
# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
._*
*~

# Python bytecode (regenerable)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
np-venv/
*-venv/

# Third-party vendor binaries (Blender exceeds GitHub's 100MB limit and is
# re-downloadable). dealership/vendor/ IS tracked: the three.js r182 module, core
# and OrbitControls are the viewer's runtime dependency and must ship in a
# fresh clone so the viewer runs offline with no manual steps (ticket #6).
tools/validation-runtime/blender-4.5.14-macos-arm64.dmg
tools/validation-runtime/blender-mount/

# Savestates (each ~11MB; re-captured live via PINE + savestate ops)
*.p2s
*.p2s.*.part

# Unpacked savestate members: EE/IOP/VU RAM, microcode, hw regs, audio/video,
# pad/usb state, PCSX2 CPU structures (read by probe tools at fixed paths;
# re-extracted from .p2s with a zstd-capable python)
*-eeMemory.bin
*-iopMemory.bin
*Memory.bin
loading-ee.bin
*MicroMem.bin
*Scratchpad.bin
*HwRegs.bin
*SPU2.bin
*USB.bin
*PAD.bin
*GS.bin
*.gs.zst
*Structures.dat
*Savestate-Version.id

# macOS PCSX2 app bundle accidentally captured under runtime/ (vendor binary,
# same class as the Blender vendor files: re-downloadable, not our work)
research/evidence/continuation/runtime/PCSX2.app/

# Experiment working sets (rebuilt by the probe tools from the above)
research/evidence/job-b-live/pairs/
research/evidence/job-b-live/members/

# Local scratch
.scratch/

# Locally supplied Gran Turismo disc inputs; never publish a disc image.
gran-turismo/game-files/

# Locally supplied Redline installers and the retained base package (>100 MB).
# Decoded native assets, extraction index and car add-on carriers remain visible.
redline/game-files/
redline/cars/shared/base/data.redplug

# Linter cache
.ruff_cache/

# Reference frames extracted from the pinned GSDumps (issue #20): commercial
# game content, regenerated by tools/recover_dump_reference_frame.py --write;
# the committed receipt carries their sha256 pins.
research/evidence/reference-frames/frames/

# Locally supplied Midnight Club 3 Remix disc input.
midnight-club-3-remix/game-files/
# Local Ghidra analysis database; source pins and MCP receipts are retained separately.
tools/validation-runtime/mc3-ghidra-20261010*
# Native shared decal packs exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit (decal.ppf) or its 50 MB
# warning size (decal_g.ppf); rederive from ISO. No tool reads either.
midnight-club-3-remix/cars/shared/assets/06472/resources/vehicle/decal.ppf
midnight-club-3-remix/cars/shared/assets/06474/resources/vehicle/decal_g.ppf
